// Title: Outlook Security Settings Updated - Registry
// ID: c3cefdf4-6703-4e1c-bad8-bf422fc5015a
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-12-28
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1137
// Description: Detects changes to the registry values related to outlook security settings
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((TargetObject = /*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Office\\*/i and TargetObject = /*\\Outlook\\Security\\*/i)) and not(((ImageFileName = /C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\.*/i or ImageFileName = /C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\.*/i) and ImageFileName = /.*\\OUTLOOK.EXE/i)))
